// Representation of another module of the base (2026-11-10, itself host; *my*): c_open_module opens the form of a "module" with the
// root - a key module (geo.vec from the use program); the text - projection of this module, not programs.
// program: 95_modules.vish
open_module geo.vec
// expect: view view=1
// expect: struct v2
// expect-not: main()
// editing in the form of another module lies in this module: open it again - Xnorm2
pointer 1 @norm2 0 0
key 1 X
key 1 Escape
open_module geo.vec
// expect: "Xnorm2("
// Ctrl+P: "Module <key>" - same
goto 1 module\sgeo.vec
// expect: view view=3
open_module no.such
// expect: text="нет модуля no.such"
